      "nonfinite": "reject"
    },
    "justification": "Fixed engineering allowances: normalized L2 2*2^-8 and peak absolute 4*2^-8 cover BF16 rounding and FP32 accumulation; not worst-case cancellation bounds. Exact constructed zero endpoints additionally use 1e-6 absolute cap. Independent FP32 grouped and direct diagnostics precede native implementation.",
    "packing": "Prepare scales once; reuse aligned encoded weights. Pad only FP4 reduction K to multiple128 using zero weight/activation values and unity padding scales. FP8 logical K576 stays576. Additional persistent model layout has explicit4GiB arena; replaced compact scales/weights are not retained.",
